<title>USA: Tower Automotive completes offering.</title>
<headline>Tower Automotive completes offering.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tower Automotive Inc said Tuesday it has completed the sale of $200 million of five percent convertible subordinated notes in a private offering.</p>
<p>The notes are due on August 1, 2004 and are convertible into Tower Automotive common stock at a conversion price of $51.75 per share.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the notes will be used to repay outstanding bank debt, the company said in a news release.</p>
<p>Tower Automotive produces stamped and welded assemblies for vehicle body structures and suspension systems for automotive manufacturers.</p>
<p>		    ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
